      "expansion_note": "Complete list/table/turn/Q&A context may exceed requested count; original blocks unchanged.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_id": "block-000427-7e861891",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[458]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 427,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Impressions include impressions displayed to users on Google Network properties participating primarily in AdMob, AdSense, and Google Ad Manager. Cost-per-impression is defined as impression-based and click-based revenues divided by our total number of impressions, and represents the average amount we charge advertisers for each impression displayed to users.",
          "text_hash": "7e8618910458ccca08ac8551e022aa4b90863d7d6bd7d78ddd3723ff87f01889",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000428-8c137d04",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[459]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 428,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "As our business evolves, we periodically review, refine, and update our methodologies for monitoring, gathering, and counting the number of paid clicks and the number of impressions, and for identifying the revenues generated by the corresponding click and impression activity.",
          "text_hash": "8c137d047dbef3bed3ea51c5ad61692299ba66069699aaa964a3b7e67db2e949",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000429-1677e5ac",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[460]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 429,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Fluctuations in our advertising revenues, as well as the change in paid clicks and cost-per-click on Google Search & other properties and the change in impressions and cost-per-impression on Google Network properties and the correlation between these items have been, and may continue to be, affected by factors in addition to the general factors described above, such as:",
          "text_hash": "1677e5acf914850081da046cfee91495ed0ed6f30ab2054b545705f481a563df",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000430-8f7f35ae",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[461]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 430,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•advertiser competition for keywords;",
          "text_hash": "8f7f35ae117f88dd0b20287bc145ac037a10e85b1b3882d0f1f01c5186c9244d",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000431-346c3891",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[462]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 431,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•changes in advertising quality, formats, delivery, or policy;",
          "text_hash": "346c38917df07c064042062b90b01846f68f2c4fc9322bdc04cf26451710ae8f",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000432-4b3efffe",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[463]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 432,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•changes in device mix;",
          "text_hash": "4b3efffe292943476c43b51d37d4425c7f44fe08de1f14350849f3bb96ca79e7",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000433-576c93c3",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[464]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 433,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•seasonal fluctuations in internet usage, advertising expenditures, and underlying business trends, such as traditional retail seasonality; and",
          "text_hash": "576c93c3cbfedcfdabc47ecbb362a3f26dd7499243eb7e6ab2374eba7af8d2dc",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000434-8e83f20c",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[465]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 434,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•traffic growth in emerging markets compared to more mature markets and across various verticals and channels.",
          "text_hash": "8e83f20c4e2a9eb86ddae6f8232d9b01399c026aa0e73cfd92e18538784bface",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000435-138d1dce",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[466]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 435,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-style": "italic",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Google Subscriptions, Platforms, and Devices",
          "text_hash": "138d1dce220dcfd8328b9f2b729f1d51ea11fbea0ae0f47029711686d380f3a1",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000436-3cc2efe6",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[467]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 436,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Google subscriptions, platforms, and devices revenues are comprised of the following:",
          "text_hash": "3cc2efe603fac8cecb652cb8c204716a8b1bcbc8eaeb882ad9e9046157cfcca9",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000437-9da7e695",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[468]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 437,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•consumer subscriptions, which primarily include revenues from YouTube services, such as YouTube TV, YouTube Music and Premium, and NFL Sunday Ticket, as well as Google One, which offers access to our most capable Gemini models;",
          "text_hash": "9da7e695e75792ccb77496ce6528f9a735ca57113629e471e47e4af14227ba13",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000438-4791dba1",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[469]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 438,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•platforms, which primarily include revenues from Google Play sales of apps and in-app purchases;",
          "text_hash": "4791dba1b2b9d82948ded39fae8d934f9a9bc74bb196ae818e66c956c54cd00d",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000439-7313cd26",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[470]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 439,
          "reported_page": 30,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
