            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•devices, which primarily include sales of the Pixel family of devices; and",
          "text_hash": "7313cd2674a1b3a8fe7f47d546c9e73bd6f3f485fea092511b03af30705dc968",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
